+./scripts/build_cpp.sh        <span class="com"># builds ITCH parser, order books, bench binaries</span></code></pre>
+
+<h3>The four ways to drive it</h3>
+<div class="scrollbox">
+<table>
+  <tr><th>What you want</th><th>Command</th><th>What you'll see</th></tr>
+  <tr>
