+    <td>Cleaning guards, CCF sign convention, budget accounting; GoogleTest for parser + books</td>
+  </tr>
+  <tr>
+    <td><strong>Latency benchmarks</strong></td>
+    <td><code>./_build/cpp/itch/bench_main</code> (map book)<br>
